WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.120
Right there!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:30.010
<i>As long as you keep working hard and believe you'll get results, things will work out.</i>

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.890
Like I can believe <i>that...</i>

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:45.170
Then how come I was taken off the regulars and kept from playing in the matches, when I'm doing the same practice as everyone else?

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:52.860
I want this revolution we all started together to be a success, but...

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.640
Amagi-senpai!

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.240
S-Sorry!

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.590
Amagi-senpai?

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:12.330
Maybe I should quit soccer...

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:46.920
See ya.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.700
See you next time!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.730
What're <i>you</i>  staring at?

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:59.750
Well, it's just that Amagi-senpai seems different from usual.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:06.290
Maybe he's just so hungry that he can't move anymore.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.520
I hope that's the case...

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.950
What's this? Just because he's not dragging you around places like usual...

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:15.690
Don't tell me you're missing that now!

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.200
Th-That's not it!

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:21.070
Our next opponent has been decided.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.430
It's Gen'ei Academy.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.720
Gen'ei Academy?

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.200
Amagi?

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:30.230
It's nothing.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:35.370
Gen'ei Academy's team has superior technique.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.610
Their play style is comparative to a magician's.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:43.160
This is their captain, their ace striker Mahoro Tadashi.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:47.270
They say he has the strongest hissatsu technique ever.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:50.120
The strongest hissatsu technique ever...

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.280
His hissatsu technique Phantom Shot holds a 100% record.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.540
Whenever he shoots it, it always lands in the goal.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.300
Wow.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.140
Mahoro-kun is also known as the stoic striker.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:07.800
No matter when, even after he scores a goal, he never shows emotion.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:16.560
Since he has full control over his emotions, he can always make calm judgments.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.530
Mahoro...

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:44.550
Stop him, Amagi!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.180
All right, I'm through!

00:04:58.580 --> 00:04:59.690
Amagi.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.530
Leave the grounds.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:04.710
Sorry, let me try again!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.860
Go home for today.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:10.990
Yes, sir.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:21.480
Aoyama, take up Amagi's position.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.110
Ichino, get warmed up too.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.720
Yes, sir!

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:31.800
Why did Coach Kidou...

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.370
That wasn't the usual Amagi-san.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.010
He seems to be worrying about something these days.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:39.670
You noticed?

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:40.690
Then why...

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:44.360
If he could, he would've already talked to us about it.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:49.450
The problem he's dealing with right now is probably something he has to resolve himself.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:54.440
Alone, huh...

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.990
Just like back then.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.570
It was back when I was about to graduate from elementary school.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:07.420
My classmates started bullying me.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.980
I didn't know why.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:14.450
Friends I had played with the day before all became my enemies.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:25.380
But only Mahoro would still be friendly with me.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:29.840
I was really happy.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:32.100
I thought I could keep going as long as I was with him.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:38.210
But after a while, he stopped talking to me for some reason.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.280
It made me sad.

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:44.870
I thought of all people, Mahoro wouldn't do that...

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:57.800
Sometime after that, the bullying stopped.

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:03.220
But it didn't make me happy.

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.280
It was painful.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.910
It felt like he left me for dead.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:13.560
Why?

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:20.660
Here, we used to play around with the soccer ball every day.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:35.920
We even promised to play soccer together once we graduated elementary school.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:57.920
Mahoro?

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:01.830
You?

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:06.610
Haven't seen you since elementary school.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:08.680
Yeah...

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:11.700
Bye.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.050
Why?!

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:20.320
Why did you stop talking to me?

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:24.140
You used to be my best friend no matter what happened!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.100
Why?

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.240
Mahoro!

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:37.580
Answer me, Mahoro!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:42.230
There... There has to be a reason for it, right?

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:46.400
Otherwise, you wouldn't purposely come to this place!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.440
Tell me the truth!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:57.180
You were an interference.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:05.940
I got tired of a coward like you constantly hanging around me.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:11.710
I will defeat Raimon in the next match.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:17.530
As Gen'ei Academy soccer club's captain, and as someone who obeys Fifth Sector.

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:22.000
It's impossible to disobey Fifth Sector.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.150
Soccer should be controlled.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.480
N-No...

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:31.130
After being bullied so much, you still don't get it?

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:38.360
Strong people are meant to be obeyed.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.460
There's no point in rebelling.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.560
You've got no chance.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:52.770
Why...

00:09:56.710 --> 00:10:00.990
You hated unjust things the most out of anyone, Mahoro!

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:13.410
I kept playing soccer thinking somewhere deep in my heart that I could make up with you someday!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.730
My reasons for playing soccer...

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.560
They're all gone now.

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:34.120
I really am all alone.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:41.450
Kageyama.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.540
You'll catch a cold out here.

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:49.700
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.800
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.100
It happened to me too.

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:13.630
There was a time when I was bullied once too.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.900
I was a transfer student.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:21.990
I wanted to make new friends.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:27.430
But I'm clumsy with my words, so I had a hard time saying what was on my mind.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:31.330
I didn't want people to dislike me, so I'd end up agreeing to everything.

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:34.480
Even when I didn't actually agree.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:42.320
The more I went on, the more I'd just go along with everything.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:49.470
As a result, I ended up getting everyone mad,
and they all got fed up with me.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:52.680
I didn't get why it happened at first.

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.440
I didn't get what I did wrong.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:12:02.040
But once I started thinking about what it'd be like in my classmates' position...

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:04.220
I realized how stupid I was.

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:10.800
After that, I told everyone my honest feelings.

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:17.870
I apologized for everything I did and let them know that I was just trying to make friends.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:23.170
Amagi-senpai.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:28.430
If you talk it out, you might clear up your misunderstandings.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.060
If you shout out, you'll feel a lot better.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:48.570
Back when I was bullied, I'd often go to a place where no one else was and shout.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:21.500
Nii-san!

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:26.150
With my brother working so hard, I can't give up either.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.830
That's great, Tsurugi.

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:38.960
Pass, pass!

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.910
Successfully escaped! {☆}

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:51.050
This sound...

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.850
Hey!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.440
Sorry, you okay?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.900
I think.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.180
Our ball!

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:07.910
Borrowing your shoulders!

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.260
Whoa!

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:55.240
Okay.

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:04.830
Whoa!!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:05.900
Not bad.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.000
You too.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.920
Not bad.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:08.740
You too.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.240
So cool!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.040
Oh, here's your ball back.

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:15.250
Thanks!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:16.810
Thanks for getting it!

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.280
See ya!

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.600
Bye bye!

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:23.250
You're one of Raimon's players, right?

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.120
Yeah.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:27.560
It's so great how you get to play all the soccer you want.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.470
They won't let me play since I'm hospitalized.

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:33.700
Then maybe you shouldn't be out here...

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.040
It's fine just once in a while.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.190
Taiyou-kun!

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:40.930
Fuyuka-san!

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:42.920
So you slipped out of your room again.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:46.320
But I was getting bored of just being in bed all day.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.690
Go back to your room.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:49.940
No thanks~

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:56.180
Once I can get out and play soccer again, let's play together!

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.260
Yeah!

00:15:57.670 --> 00:16:01.160
Be sure to win the next match! I'll be cheering you on!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.890
See you, Tenma!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.520
See you!

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.840
Did I tell him my name?

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.360
What will I ever do with him...

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:14.810
Sorry that he caused you trouble.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.300
O-Oh, it's okay.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:20.670
He looked really healthy to me.

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:22.630
Is he actually sick?

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:23.650
Yes.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:27.790
His name's Amemiya Taiyou, and he's being hospitalized for examination.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.160
Examination?

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:32.170
So it's not that serious of a sickness.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.340
That's great.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.540
His name's Taiyou, huh?

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:47.280
Raimon Jr. High has overtly made their stance of revolt against Fifth Sector.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:52.810
The more they win, the more the vote shifts to the revolution.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:17:00.620
You haven't forgotten that Holy Road is also an election that decides the next Holy Emperor, have you?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:07.350
Ishido-san, at this rate, you will lose your current status as the Holy Emperor.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.080
This will be settled soon.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:15.550
It's my mission to control soccer and save it.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.930
I'm sorry for the trouble I caused.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.310
Please let me join practice.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.000
All right.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.810
I'll get past you again today!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:41.840
I'll play in the next match no matter what.

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:43.520
I have to!

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:48.080
We can't go back to the past.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:54.300
But I can tell him that our revolution is the right thing to do!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.080
I couldn't tell him back then,

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:00.870
but I'll make sure he understands this time!

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.210
I'll tell Mahoro...

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:12.170
About my feelings, with the soccer we love!

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.560
That play just now...

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.360
Good work, Amagi!

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:23.030
Yeah.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:27.260
You know something about this, don't you?

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.670
N-No.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.050
Really?

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:32.710
R-Really.

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:43.050
Keep this a secret. It's a promise from man to man.

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:44.350
Okay!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:50.720
Someoka, the conflict you pointed out has been resolved.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:46.610
I'm coming!

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.340
So this is Gen'ei Academy.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.640
I don't like something about them.

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:07.370
Mahoro-san...

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:18.200
This is Pinball Stadium.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.330
Awesome!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.750
We don't know what kind of traps are set inside.

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.410
Keep your guard up.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:25.080
Yeah.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.270
Mahoro-kun.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:42.710
Wait!

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.680
I don't need it!

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:49.640
You're hurt, so put it on!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:51.820
They're falling, they're falling!

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:55.670
1, 2, 3, 4...

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:01.470
Why won't you tell Amagi-kun the truth?

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.330
If I did, it'll only hurt him.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:17.270
I think this is a good chance to tell Amagi-kun.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:19.340
It's not necessary.

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:23.860
Not for that coward who can't accept reality.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:32.500
Then why do you look so much in pain...?

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.950
Excuse me, you're one of Raimon's players, right?

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:38.710
Y-Yes?

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:45.050
I was one of Amagi-kun's classmates in elementary school, Kousaka Yukie.

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.700
Amagi-senpai's...

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.150
Tsurugi.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:07.610
Let's win this one.

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:12.160
The fourth match in the Holy Road Nationals!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.390
Raimon Jr. High versus Gen'ei Academy!

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:17.300
The players will be entering soon!

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:02.900
It's an Avatar right off the bat!

00:23:02.900 --> 00:23:05.050
Isn't that a penalty?!

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:06.360
It's gotta be a penalty!

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:07.710
No, it's allowed, Matsuki-san.

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:09.220
Oh, then keep 'em coming!

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:10.310
Go, go!

00:23:10.310 --> 00:23:13.440
Inazuma Eleven GO the Movie: The Ultimate Bonds, Gryphon

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:15.540
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:34.610
It's Raimon versus Gen'ei Academy for the quarter-finals!

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:37.770
Their phantasmagoric plays put us in big trouble!

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:42.320
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Impossible to Defend! Phantom Shot!!

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:43.980
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:55.780
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:03.440
If you talk it out, you'll clear up your misunderstandings!

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:04.250
That's all!
